4. Calculate the total cost of the purchase by adding the adjusted car price to the combined price of the clothes and the book.

Here's the C# code for the function:
```csharp
public static double CalculateTotalCost(double carPrice, double clothesPrice, double bookPrice)
{
    double combinedClothesAndBookPrice = clothesPrice + bookPrice;

    if (carPrice < combinedClothesAndBookPrice * 2)
    {
        carPrice = combinedClothesAndBookPrice * 2;
    }

    return carPrice + combinedClothesAndBookPrice;
}
```
